Implement the unified call extraction plan in `.ai/plans/unified-call-extraction.md`. The goal is to move all `variable.method()` call site detection into the script/tag parsers so there's a single pass through content that extracts refs, links, resolvers, AND call sites. This eliminates the separate line-based `FuncCalls` scanner in `result.go`. Follow the execution order in the plan — each step should compile and pass tests before moving to the next. The unresolved CLI command, exportDeps, and findRefs commands must produce the same results after the refactor.
